# Caps Lock and Left Ctrl do not interrupt each other; both tap Esc if released under 350 ms.
0 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
0 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
50 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
50 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
100 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK up
100 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
100 out key KEY_ESC down
100 out key KEY_ESC up
150 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
150 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
150 out key KEY_ESC down
150 out key KEY_ESC up
